Z||000000||Borgio||11-02-2001||04:01 PM|||| I mean while sleeping. I just did about an hour ago. I was sleeping 'cause i was on the forum last night 'till after three, and then I had homework due this morning, so I didn't sleep at all.<P>  It wasn't a terribly interesting dream. I was driving, I think like an 85gt or something and my older brother was driving an ,84 2m4, both black. Mine was EXTREMELY fast and awesome to drive, but besides the extreme speed what was most dreamlike about it was that, I was having trouble seeing. I kept almost hitting into stuff, including when I tried to squeeze my way inbetween two of my fieros in a parking lot onto the street, proceeding to go extremely fast while not being able to see. I don't know why I couldn't see, something was in the way, in the front and back. It really isn't that easy to see out the back in real life though. Thats all I remember, as I said, not that interesting, but maybe some of you have had some better ones.<P> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||Master_Sushi||11-02-2001||04:29 PM||||I use to dream about my 88 coupe when I first got it, mostly about driving it places and such.<BR>I sold it about 2 or 3 weeks ago, and I was dreaming sad things about it that night. Like the owner that bought it smashed it, or he was abusing it. I don't remember really because dreams are very strange.<P>Anyway I see your form Kokomo! I use to live in Kokomo about 4 years ago. Its a fun place, its really growing quite a bit. I sometime miss it.<P>What kind of fiero(s) do you have anyway?||||reg||1
Z||000002||Borgio||11-02-2001||04:41 PM||||Yeah, I live in Kokomo. Its a pretty cool place. I'm sure Niagra is nice too though. But right now I'm at college in Oklahoma City. I have three silver '87GTs. One is a project car, one is a parts car, and the other is a driving car. But both of the cars I passed in my dream were mine and both were silver, but one was a notchback, non-aero(I forget the correct name) nose. What can I say, it was a dream.||||reg||1
Z||000003||Little Duce Coupe||11-02-2001||04:46 PM||||Twice, not long after I got my car.<P>I had once seen a Fiero do a 360 in the middle of the freeway.. was impressed that the car did'nt "unsettle" it kept all four wheels firmly down.<P>I dreamt that I took the last corner going to my house to fast (usually do) and I did an end around and went back first into a light pole and totaled the car.<P>Been a long time for that one.. but swapping ends was always one of my bigger concerns.<BR>Went through a set of back tires in little of a year when I first got it... could say I used to go fast around any corner I could find... Not anymore though got tired of getting nagged about how much I spent on tires.<P>------------------<BR>Little Duce Coupe<BR>"You Don't Know What She Costs"||||reg||1
Z||000004||Brian87egotrip||11-02-2001||04:48 PM||||I dreamnt one nite that my car was stripped to the chassis. I fell to my knees and let out the loudest damn NOOOO!!!  I woke up in a sweat. Worst dream I've ever had. ||||reg||1
