Z||000006||tomanyfieros||11-02-2001||05:45 PM||||hey, i had a dream last night..... it was my 87 GT 5 speed, and my 87 maroon GT (it was running!!!!) and a guy wanted a ride in my GT, so i dont remember why i was there, but i was at my high school.... and i was driving fast through there, and i went through the lot, down to the carwash, and turned around and drove really fast back to the bus garage..... then when i finally got it parked, i got out and started working on a bus, and then a state highway A$$hole came in, and asked me if i knew of a fiero around.... i asked why, and then i saw him walked out and his car was full of dust and he grabed a comb and combed his hair and dirt fell out, he arested me and then i woke up as he put me in a 4 door fiero. strange dream. <BR>Jason||||reg||1
