Z||000008||CoolBlue87GT||11-02-2001||06:19 PM||||Oh, yes. I've had a really good one, I have it over and over again.<P>I dream about finding a Fiero with really low mileage , that's in perfect shape. A really nice Blue 87 GT. One that's been loved and pampered all it's life.<P>Untouched by those that would rip the top off and tear into it's very sole only to put another body on it. <P>Suddenly I look around, and I found one, Oh, she is just a beauty. The sun is gleaming off the pristen paint. Wow, the sticker is still on the window. Could it be ?<P>But oh my gosh, who's that ??<P>Oh no !, it's Archie, he gets to it first. I yell, and beg him not to kill her. He looks back and laughs while picking up tool that makes a dredfull sound.<P>I've only got a few seconds to save her, what can I do, how can I save her ? <P>I scream out "Archie, look out for that incoming windshield" !! <P>Quickly as I see he's going through a tearible flashback, I reach out for the hose and disconnect the "death tool"<P>I jump in the car, and she starts right up, and we both as one, fly out of the garage !  I saved her !<P>When I wake up, I rush to the garage to make sure she's okay !!<P>What's that? , I hear a distant laugh, gosh did it really happen ? !!<P>LOL.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/1cool.jpg"> ||||reg||6
