Z||000013||Mattyman||11-03-2001||11:42 AM||||Back when I really wanted a Fiero and thought I would never get one, I had a very upsetting dream, well the dream was good but...  I had a dream that my parents had something for me in the garage, so I walked down and there was my very own Fiero sitting there.  I jumped right in took it out and started crusing around everywhere.  Then the terrible part happened. I woke up.  Man did that really suck, I was depressed for the rest of the day.  But little did I know that my dream would come true with a few minor details changed.  I had to buy the car with my own money.||||reg||1
